[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           (Left\nside).</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (Left\nside).</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the fog light trim (1b) after\nhaving released it from the fastening spring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014081.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt fixing the air filter cold air intake to the resonator.</p><p>2. Press the springs (2a) and remove the air filter cold air intake\n(2b) from the wheel arch.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014082.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the cold air intake for the air filter\nback in its housing.</p><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the air filter\ncold air intake to the resonator.</p><p>Place the fog light trim back in its housing\nand secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (Left\nside).</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           (Left\nside).</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolt fixing the air filter cold air intake to the bodyshell.</p><p>2. Release the retaining springs fastening the cold air intake to\nthe air filter casing.</p><p>3. Remove the air filter cold air intake.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014594.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the cold air intake for the air filter\nback in its housing and connect it to the air filter until the retaining\nsprings are attached.</p><p>Tighten the bolt securing the cold air\nintake for air filter to the bodywork.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238445\">5540B16</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p><a href=\"#/3237527\">1048A21</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p><a href=\"#/3237527\">1048A21</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/3238445\">5540B16</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           (Left side).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a), release the air cleaner cold air intake (1b)\nfrom the air cleaner and remove.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069041.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the air cleaner cold air intake back\nin its housing and secure it using the appropriate bolt.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and remove the cold air intake for the air\nfilter (1b), after disengaging it from the air filter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069477.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the air cleaner cold air intake back\nin its housing and secure it using the appropriate bolt.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3239044\">7210E10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238951\">7055A41</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238952\">7055A43</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]